{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202605211731463204d888cca54cb5","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have enough information to compile the market research. Let me create the research report with the findings:\n\nFrom my research, I've identified several high-value content directions for 2026:\n\n1. **AI + Web3 Monetization Platforms**\n   - Audience: Content creators, developers, crypto enthusiasts\n   - Monetization: Platform revenue sharing, selling AI models/services, data royalties\n   - Competition: High but growing rapidly\n\n2. **Agentic AI Development Tools**\n   - Audience: Developers, teams wanting to automate workflows\n   - Monetization: SaaS tools, automation templates, CLI tools with freemium\n   - Competition: Medium - emerging market\n\n3. **Full-stack Framework Education (Next.js, Remix, RSC)**\n   - Audience: Web developers learning server-first architecture\n   - Monetization: Courses, tutorials, Medium/Dev.to articles, GitHub templates\n   - Competition: Medium-High (but always in demand)\n\n4. **Accessibility & Compliance Content**\n   - Audience: Teams facing legal mandates, product teams\n   - Monetization: Consulting, templates, tools, compliance checklists\n   - Competition: Low-Medium (specialized knowledge required)\n\n5. **Edge Computing & WebAssembly Tutorials**\n   - Audience: Advanced developers building desktop-class web apps\n   - Monetization: Advanced tutorials, code templates, specialized courses\n   - Competition: Low (cutting-edge, requires deep expertise)\n\nNow let me write this to the file and complete the task.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"63d204da-2dcb-41ec-97b3-16575212914d","uuid":"4894ade8-a855-4c34-8925-791b21950624"}
